---
// The planner form, results, editor and print styles. All logic is in src/scripts/studyTimetableUi.mjs.
---

<section class="stm" id="stm-tool" aria-labelledby="stm-title">
  <h2 id="stm-title">Make your study timetable</h2>
  <p class="stm-note"><b>Private by design:</b> everything you type stays in this browser. The planner asks for no name, phone number or email, and sends nothing to this site. On a shared computer, press Clear my data when you finish.</p>

  <p class="stm-toprow">
    <button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-example">Fill with a made-up example</button>
    <button type="button" class="stm-btn stm-btn--warn" id="stm-clear">Clear my data</button>
  </p>
  <p class="stm-hint">The example uses five common school subjects and an exam date 35 days from today. It is not a real exam date.</p>
  <p class="stm-example-flag" id="stm-example-flag" role="status" hidden>This is a made-up example. Press Clear my data when you are done looking at it.</p>
  <p class="stm-saved" id="stm-saved" role="status"></p>

  <form id="stm-form" novalidate>
    <fieldset class="stm-box">
      <legend>1. Your subjects</legend>
      <p class="stm-hint">Confidence: 1 means you find it hard, 5 means you are comfortable. How much it counts: 1 is a small part of your marks, 5 is a very big part. Weaker and bigger subjects get more time.</p>
      <p class="stm-hint" id="stm-chip-hint">Tap a subject to add it, or type your own below.</p>
      <div class="stm-chips" id="stm-chips" role="group" aria-labelledby="stm-chip-hint"></div>
      <div id="stm-subjects"></div>
      <p><button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-add-subject">Add a subject</button></p>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="stm-box">
      <legend>2. Dates</legend>
      <div class="stm-grid2">
        <div><label for="stm-startDate">Start date</label><input id="stm-startDate" type="date" /></div>
        <div><label for="stm-examDate">Last exam date (used for every subject without its own date)</label><input id="stm-examDate" type="date" /></div>
      </div>
      <p class="stm-hint">Copy exam dates from your official date sheet. If you do not have one yet, use your best guess and make the timetable again later.</p>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="stm-box">
      <legend>3. Your day and week</legend>
      <div class="stm-grid2">
        <div><label for="stm-wake">Wake-up time</label><input id="stm-wake" type="time" step="300" /></div>
        <div><label for="stm-bed">Bedtime (before midnight)</label><input id="stm-bed" type="time" step="300" /></div>
        <div><label for="stm-sleepMin">Minimum sleep to protect</label><select id="stm-sleepMin"></select></div>
        <div><label for="stm-focus">When do you study best?</label><select id="stm-focus"></select></div>
        <div><label for="stm-hoursWeekday">Study hours on a weekday (Monday to Friday)</label><input id="stm-hoursWeekday" type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.5" inputmode="decimal" /></div>
        <div><label for="stm-hoursWeekend">Study hours on a weekend day (Saturday, Sunday)</label><input id="stm-hoursWeekend" type="number" min="0" max="10" step="0.5" inputmode="decimal" /></div>
      </div>
      <p class="stm-hint">Morning person: sessions start as early as your free time allows. Evening person: they sit as late as it allows.</p>
      <p class="stm-hint" id="stm-sleep-line"></p>
      <p class="stm-hint stm-hint--care" id="stm-hint-hours" role="status"></p>
      <h3 class="stm-h3">Fixed blocks</h3>
      <p class="stm-hint">Add anything that cannot move: school, tuition, meals, sport, travel. The times below are examples, so change them to match your week. The planner never studies inside a block.</p>
      <div id="stm-blocks"></div>
      <p><button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-add-block">Add a fixed block</button></p>
    </fieldset>

    <fieldset class="stm-box">
      <legend>4. How you like to study</legend>
      <div class="stm-grid2">
        <div><label for="stm-sessionMin">Study session length</label><select id="stm-sessionMin"></select></div>
        <div><label for="stm-breakMin">Break between sessions</label><select id="stm-breakMin"></select></div>
        <div><label for="stm-gaps">Spaced revision gaps, in days</label><input id="stm-gaps" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="24" autocomplete="off" /></div>
        <div><label for="stm-restDay">Weekly rest day</label><select id="stm-restDay"></select></div>
        <div><label for="stm-mockDay">Weekly mock-test day</label><select id="stm-mockDay"></select></div>
        <div><label for="stm-mockMin">Mock test length</label><select id="stm-mockMin"></select></div>
        <div><label for="stm-examDayHours">Study hours on an exam day (for the next paper)</label><input id="stm-examDayHours" type="number" min="0" max="6" step="0.5" inputmode="decimal" /></div>
        <div><label for="stm-examDayFrom">On an exam day, study from</label><input id="stm-examDayFrom" type="time" step="300" /></div>
      </div>
      <p class="stm-hint">Spaced revision: type days after a study session, such as 1, 3, 7 or 1-3-7. Leave it empty for none. A plan shorter than 8 days has no rest day, and mock tests need a plan of at least 14 days.</p>
    </fieldset>

    <div class="stm-actions"><button type="submit" class="stm-btn stm-btn--primary" id="stm-make">Make my timetable</button></div>
    <div class="stm-errors" id="stm-errors" tabindex="-1" role="alert" hidden></div>
    <div class="stm-replace" id="stm-replace" role="alertdialog" aria-labelledby="stm-replace-text" hidden>
      <p id="stm-replace-text">You have ticked or changed some sessions. Making the timetable again replaces them. Do you want to replace your current timetable?</p>
      <p><button type="button" class="stm-btn stm-btn--warn" id="stm-replace-yes">Yes, replace it</button> <button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-replace-no">No, keep my changes</button></p>
    </div>
  </form>

  <p class="stm-status" id="stm-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>

  <section class="stm-results" id="stm-results" aria-labelledby="stm-results-title" hidden>
    <h2 id="stm-results-title" tabindex="-1">Your timetable</h2>
    <p id="stm-summary"></p>
    <div class="stm-warnings" id="stm-warnings" hidden></div>
    <div class="stm-progress">
      <p id="stm-progress-text"></p>
      <progress id="stm-progress" max="100" value="0" aria-label="Share of sessions done"></progress>
    </div>
    <div class="stm-actions">
      <button type="button" class="stm-btn stm-btn--primary" id="stm-pdf">Download PDF (A4 landscape)</button>
      <button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-print-btn">Print (A4 landscape)</button>
    </div>

    <h3 class="stm-h3" id="stm-today-title">Today</h3>
    <div class="stm-daylist" id="stm-today-list"></div>
    <div class="stm-actions">
      <button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-copy">Copy the next 4 days for WhatsApp</button>
      <button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-wa">Open WhatsApp with my plan</button>
    </div>

    <h3 class="stm-h3">Hours for each subject</h3>
    <div class="stm-tablewrap" id="stm-hours"></div>

    <h3 class="stm-h3">Weekly grid</h3>
    <div class="stm-weeknav">
      <button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-prev">Earlier week</button>
      <p id="stm-week-label" tabindex="-1" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-next">Later week</button>
      <label class="stm-weekpick">Go to week <select id="stm-week-select"></select></label>
      <button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-today" hidden>Go to this week</button>
    </div>
    <p class="stm-hint">Press a session to change its subject, day or time, tick it done, or delete it. On a computer you can also drag a session to another day. Grey blocks are your fixed blocks.</p>
    <div class="stm-gridwrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Weekly timetable grid. It scrolls sideways on a small screen.">
      <div id="stm-grid"></div>
    </div>
    <ul class="stm-legend" id="stm-legend" aria-label="Subject colours"></ul>

    <h3 class="stm-h3">Day by day</h3>
    <p><button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-showall" aria-pressed="false">Show every day of the plan</button></p>
    <div class="stm-daylist" id="stm-days"></div>

    <div class="stm-care">
      <p>Study time is not the only thing that counts, so keep your sleep, meals, movement and time with people you like. If exam worry feels too big, try the <a href="/services/assessments/exam-stress-self-assessment/">exam stress self-assessment</a> or talk to someone you trust.</p>
      <p>Tele-MANAS (14416) is a free national mental health helpline run by the health ministry. This is not medical advice; talk to a doctor or counsellor.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <dialog class="stm-dialog" id="stm-editor" aria-labelledby="stm-ed-title">
    <form id="stm-ed-form" method="dialog" novalidate>
      <h2 id="stm-ed-title">Edit session</h2>
      <div class="stm-ed-grid">
        <div><label for="stm-ed-subject">Subject</label><select id="stm-ed-subject"></select></div>
        <div><label for="stm-ed-day">Day</label><select id="stm-ed-day"></select></div>
        <div><label for="stm-ed-start">Time</label><select id="stm-ed-start"></select></div>
        <div><label for="stm-ed-note">Short note (optional)</label><input id="stm-ed-note" type="text" maxlength="80" autocomplete="off" placeholder="For example Chapter 4 sums" /></div>
      </div>
      <p><label class="stm-inline"><input type="checkbox" id="stm-ed-done" /> Mark this session done</label></p>
      <p class="stm-ed-msg" id="stm-ed-hint" role="status"></p>
      <p class="stm-ed-msg stm-ed-msg--err" id="stm-ed-error" role="alert"></p>
      <div class="stm-actions">
        <button type="submit" class="stm-btn stm-btn--primary" id="stm-ed-save">Save</button>
        <button type="button" class="stm-btn" id="stm-ed-cancel">Cancel</button>
        <button type="button" class="stm-btn stm-btn--warn" id="stm-ed-delete">Delete this session</button>
      </div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
</section>

<script>
  import { initTimetable } from '../scripts/studyTimetableUi.mjs';
  initTimetable(document.getElementById('stm-tool'));
</script>

<style is:global>
  .stm{margin:1rem 0;padding:1.25rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);min-width:0}
  .stm *{box-sizing:border-box}
  .stm h2{margin-top:0}
  .stm p,.stm li{line-height:1.6}
  .stm-note,.stm-hint{font-size:.88rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78)}
  .stm-hint{margin:.3rem 0 .7rem}
  .stm-hint--care{color:#f3cf70;font-weight:600}
  .stm-sr{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0);white-space:nowrap}
  .stm-toprow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;margin:.8rem 0 .3rem}
  .stm-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem;margin:.2rem 0 .8rem}
  .stm-chip{min-height:44px;padding:.3rem .85rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4);border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;cursor:pointer}
  .stm-chip:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
  .stm-chip:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #e5b84a;outline-offset:2px}
  .stm-saved,.stm-status{font-size:.88rem;color:#9ff3e6;min-height:1.3em;margin:.4rem 0}
  .stm-example-flag{margin:.5rem 0;padding:.6rem .8rem;border:1px dashed rgba(229,184,74,.7);border-radius:10px;color:#f3cf70;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem}
  .stm-example-flag[hidden],.stm-results[hidden],.stm-errors[hidden],.stm-replace[hidden]{display:none}
  .stm-box{min-width:0;margin:0 0 1rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17);border-radius:12px}
  .stm-box legend{padding:0 .4rem;font-weight:700}
  .stm-h3{margin:1.4rem 0 .4rem;font-size:1.1rem}
  .stm label{display:block;margin:.55rem 0 .25rem;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600}
  .stm input[type=text],.stm input[type=date],.stm input[type=time],.stm input[type=number],.stm select{width:100%;min-width:0;max-width:100%;min-height:44px;padding:.5rem .65rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);border-radius:10px;background:#101626;color:#fff;font:inherit;font-weight:400}
  .stm select option{color:#111;background:#fff}
  .stm input[type=date]:focus-within,.stm input[type=time]:focus-within,.stm input:focus-visible,.stm select:focus-visible,.stm button:focus-visible,.stm summary:focus-visible,.stm-gridwrap:focus-visible,.stm [tabindex="-1"]:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #e5b84a;outline-offset:2px}
  .stm [aria-invalid="true"]{border-color:#ff9d8f;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(255,157,143,.45)}
  .stm-grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(14rem,1fr));gap:.1rem 1rem}
  .stm-row,.stm-brow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(11rem,1fr));gap:0 .8rem;align-items:end;padding:.5rem 0 .8rem;border-top:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
  .stm-row:first-child,.stm-brow:first-child{border-top:0}
  .stm-f{min-width:0}
  .stm-remove{justify-self:start;margin-top:.5rem}
  .stm-times{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.6rem}
  .stm-days{margin:.4rem 0 0;padding:0;border:0;min-width:0}
  .stm-days legend{padding:0;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600}
  .stm-dchks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem}
  .stm-dchk{position:relative;display:inline-flex;margin:0!important;width:44px;height:44px}
  .stm-dchk input{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;opacity:0;cursor:pointer}
  .stm-dchk span[aria-hidden]{display:grid;place-items:center;width:100%;height:100%;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);border-radius:10px;background:#101626;font-weight:700;pointer-events:none}
  .stm-dchk input:checked+span{background:#0b766d;border-color:#2dd4bf;color:#fff}
  .stm-dchk input:focus-visible+span{outline:3px solid #e5b84a;outline-offset:2px}
  .stm-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;margin:.8rem 0}
  .stm-btn{min-height:46px;padding:.55rem .95rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;cursor:pointer}
  .stm-btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
  .stm-btn--primary{background:#0b766d;border-color:#2dd4bf}
  .stm-btn--warn{border-color:rgba(255,140,120,.7);color:#ffd1c8}
  .stm-mini{min-height:44px;min-width:44px;padding:.25rem .85rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-weight:600;font-size:.84rem;cursor:pointer}
  .stm-errors{margin:1rem 0;padding:.8rem 1rem;border:1px solid #ff9d8f;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,120,100,.1)}
  .stm-errors ul{margin:.3rem 0 0;padding-left:1.2rem}
  .stm-errors a{color:#ffd1c8;font-weight:600}
  .stm-replace{margin:1rem 0;padding:.8rem 1rem;border:1px solid rgba(229,184,74,.7);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(229,184,74,.08)}
  .stm-warnings{margin:.6rem 0;padding:.6rem 1rem;border:1px solid rgba(229,184,74,.6);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(229,184,74,.08);color:#f6df9f}
  .stm-warnings ul{margin:0;padding-left:1.2rem}
  .stm-progress progress{width:100%;height:14px;accent-color:#2dd4bf}
  .stm-tablewrap{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto}
  .stm-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.88rem}
  .stm-table th,.stm-table td{padding:.5rem .6rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);text-align:left;vertical-align:top}
  .stm-table thead th{background:rgba(18,154,141,.22)}
  .stm-table tfoot th,.stm-table tfoot td{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06)}
  .stm-dot{display:inline-block;width:.8rem;height:.8rem;margin-right:.4rem;border:2px solid;border-radius:3px;vertical-align:-.1rem;flex:none}
  .stm-weeknav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.6rem}
  .stm-weeknav p{margin:0;font-weight:700;flex:1 1 12rem;text-align:center}
  .stm-weekpick{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin:0!important}
  .stm-weekpick select{width:auto;max-width:100%}
  .stm-gridwrap{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;border-radius:12px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #c9d0d6}
  .stm-gridwrap .stm-grid{min-width:700px}
  .stm-grid{--ppm:1.15px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:3.2rem repeat(7,minmax(0,1fr));color:#14181f;font-size:.74rem}
  .stm-g-axis,.stm-g-col{min-width:0;border-left:1px solid #d6dbe0}
  .stm-g-axis{border-left:0}
  .stm-g-head{height:3.1rem;padding:.2rem .3rem;border-bottom:2px solid #9aa4ad;background:#eef1f4;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden}
  .stm-g-head b{font-size:.78rem}.stm-g-head span{font-size:.68rem;color:#3b4350;overflow-wrap:anywhere;line-height:1.2}
  .stm-g-axisbody,.stm-g-body{position:relative;height:calc(var(--span) * var(--ppm))}
  .stm-g-hour{position:absolute;left:.15rem;top:calc(var(--m) * var(--ppm) - .5em);font-size:.68rem;color:#3b4350}
  .stm-g-line{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:calc(var(--m) * var(--ppm));border-top:1px solid #e3e7ea}
  .stm-g-col--off .stm-g-body{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#f4f5f7,#f4f5f7 6px,#eceef1 6px,#eceef1 12px)}
  .stm-g-col--rest .stm-g-body{background:#f1f7f1}
  .stm-g-col--catchup .stm-g-body{background:#fbf6e6}
  .stm-g-body.is-over{outline:3px dashed #0b766d;outline-offset:-3px}
  .stm-g-fixed{position:absolute;left:2px;right:2px;top:calc(var(--m) * var(--ppm));height:calc(var(--len) * var(--ppm));background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#e3e6ea,#e3e6ea 5px,#d4d9de 5px,#d4d9de 10px);border:1px solid #aab2ba;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;color:#2b3340;padding:.1rem .25rem;font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.15}
  .stm-g-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:start center;padding-top:.6rem;pointer-events:none;color:#2b4a35;font-weight:700;font-size:.78rem;z-index:1}
  .stm-g-slot{position:absolute;left:2px;right:2px;top:calc(var(--m) * var(--ppm));height:calc(var(--len) * var(--ppm));margin:0;padding:.1rem .25rem;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--edge);border-left:4px solid var(--edge);border-radius:4px;color:#14181f;text-align:left;font:inherit;font-size:.7rem;line-height:1.15;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;display:flex;flex-direction:column;z-index:2}
  .stm-g-slot:hover{filter:brightness(.97);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(11,118,109,.5)}
  .stm-g-slot:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #0b3f9c;outline-offset:1px;z-index:5}
  .stm-g-slot.is-dragging{opacity:.5}
  .stm-t-name{font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .stm-t-kind{font-size:.66rem}
  .stm-t-time{font-size:.64rem;color:#2b3340}
  .stm-g-slot.is-short .stm-t-kind,.stm-g-slot.is-short .stm-t-time{display:none}
  .stm-k-revise{border-style:dashed;border-left-style:solid}
  .stm-k-mock{border-width:2px;border-left-width:5px}
  .stm-k-final{background-image:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.55) 0 4px,transparent 4px 8px)}
  .stm-t-done{font-style:normal;font-weight:800;font-size:.64rem;color:#0b5c2e}
  .stm-g-slot.is-done .stm-t-name{text-decoration:line-through}
  .stm-legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem 1rem;list-style:none;margin:.6rem 0;padding:0;font-size:.84rem}
  .stm-legend li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem}
  .stm-legend i{display:inline-block;width:1rem;height:1rem;border:2px solid;border-radius:3px}
  .stm-legend .stm-sw-fixed{background:repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,#e3e6ea,#e3e6ea 3px,#c9cfd5 3px,#c9cfd5 6px);border-color:#aab2ba}
  .stm-daylist{display:grid;gap:.7rem}
  .stm-day{padding:.7rem .9rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04)}
  .stm-day h4{margin:0 0 .3rem;font-size:1rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.2rem .6rem;align-items:baseline}
  .stm-badge{font-size:.74rem;font-weight:700;padding:.1rem .5rem;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.14)}
  .stm-badge--exam{background:#7a2e2e}.stm-badge--rest{background:#235b3a}.stm-badge--catchup{background:#6b5412}.stm-badge--mock{background:#1d4f8a}
  .stm-day-sum{font-size:.82rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);font-weight:400}
  .stm-day-note{margin:.2rem 0;font-size:.88rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.82)}
  .stm-slots{list-style:none;margin:.3rem 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:.3rem}
  .stm-slot-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem}
  .stm-chk{display:flex!important;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;margin:0!important;min-height:44px;flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;font-weight:400!important;cursor:pointer}
  .stm-chk input{width:1.4rem;height:1.4rem;flex:none;accent-color:#2dd4bf}
  .stm-slot-text{overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .stm-slot-row.is-done .stm-slot-text{text-decoration:line-through;color:rgba(255,255,255,.78)}
  .stm-care p{margin:.3rem 0}
